# Arithmetic with non-numeric argument: type checker rejects String operand via
# Addable MPTC — no instance for Addable String Int.
# The function is never called so eval succeeds; type checker catches the mismatch.
[f: [fn [let x@String] [+ x 1]]]
=== out
["f": [fn [let x] ...]]

=== warn
[TypeError] no instance for Addable String Int
